From: Codex Agent <codex-agent@invalid>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 17:18:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] showtime: identify the current MPRIS track

Expose a D-Bus object path for loaded media so clients can use absolute
SetPosition. Bind requests to the current URI and use an integer conversion
from microseconds to GStreamer nanoseconds, leaving relative Seek intact.

Use the MPRIS NoTrack path until metadata describes the selected URI.
Ignore requests carrying a stale track ID or a position outside the known
duration.

